      "statement": "The jwt middleware throws at construction if secret, alg or crypto.subtle.importKey is missing, reads the token from the Authorization Bearer header or else a (plain or signed) cookie, throws HTTPException(401) with a WWW-Authenticate response on missing, malformed or invalid tokens, and on success stores the payload with c.set('jwtPayload').",
